<view class="page"><view class="topbar" style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px;"><view class="topbar-inner" style="height: {{navBarHeight}}px;"><view class="back" bindtap="goBack">‹</view><text class="nav-title">信院论坛</text><view class="more">•••</view></view></view><view class="nav-space" style="height: {{statusBarHeight + navBarHeight}}px;"></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="section-title"><text class="required">*</text> 选择原因</text><view class="radio-row"><view class="radio-option" wx:for="{{reasons}}" wx:key="*this" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="selectReason"><view class="radio {{reasonIndex===index?'checked':''}}"></view>{{item}}</view></view><view class="divider"></view><text class="section-title"><text class="required">*</text> 取消接单理由</text><textarea class="textarea" placeholder="请输入取消接单理由..." maxlength="200" value="{{reasonText}}" bindinput="onReasonText"/><view class="chips"><view class="chip" wx:for="{{presets}}" wx:key="*this" data-text="{{item}}" bindtap="usePreset">{{item}}</view></view></view>
  <view class="card upload-card"><text class="section-title">上传图片证明</text><view class="upload-box" bindtap="chooseImage"><image wx:if="{{images.length===0}}" src="/assets/icons/camera.png" mode="aspectFit"/><image wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="*this" src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text class="upload-count">{{images.length}} / 3</text></view></view>
  <view class="warm-tip">温馨提示：<br/>1、在30分钟内取消接单，若为发单人原因，需征求对方同意，才能取消接单；<br/>2、超过30分钟取消接单，无论原因，均需征求发单人同意后，才能取消接单；<br/>3、自身原因多次取消接单会降低完成率，完成率过低将被系统冻结接单功能；<br/>4、严禁以任何形式引导用户私下交易。 <text>举报领券</text></view>
  <view class="bottom-actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="submit">确认提交</button><button class="primary" bindtap="goBack">我再想想</button></view>
</view>
